  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of lifesaving humanitarian assistance to children and their families affected by violence in Rakhine State, Burma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Provision of lifesaving humanitarian assistance to children and their families affected by violence in Rakhine State, Burma is a component of Humanitarian Assistance in Rakhine State reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xa3;3,074,444. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services, Disaster prevention and preparedness, Immediate post-emergency reconstruction and rehabilitation.</narrative>
  </description>
